  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Creating Conditions for Peace in Papua New Guinea Highlands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project forms a component of a comprehensive UN joint programme in Papua New Guinea (PNG) entitled &#x201c;PNG Highlands Joint Programme for Peace and Development (2020-2022)&#x201d;, funded by the UN Secretary-General&apos;s Peacebuilding Fund and implemented by IOM. The overarching objective of this project is to promote peacebuilding and community stabilization through an integrated multi-dimensional intervention. This is done in close coordination with provincial and local government partners, and specifically targets the replication of a successful community-based peace and development approach for development planning and capacity building of local partners on displacement profiling and tracking skills.</narrative>
  </description>
